  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GCF Task Force: Implementing Subnational Programs for Sustainable Forest</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports The Governors&#x2019; Climate and Forests Task Force (GCF). The GCFTF is a unique subnational collaboration between states and provinces from, among others, Brazil, Indonesia, Mexico, Nigeria, Peru, Spain, and the United States. The GCF seeks to advance jurisdictional programs for reducing emissions from deforestation and land use and link these activities with emerging greenhouse gas (GHG) compliance regimes and other pay-for-performance opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
